gameon-1sxlct9.description:
Dual charging dock, with red handle color design, with a display window indicating the charging status easily at any time. Elegance and beautiful appearance. 



 Product Overview:


• With PS5 stardust red handle color design, using intelligent micro-control circuit technology to manage charging instructions; 

• Two PS5 controllers can be quickly charged at the same time (90% of the power is charged by fast charging, and the last 10% of the power is charged by constant voltage trickle. It takes about 3 hours to fully charge it); 

• The display window is designed with red and green handle charging status patterns to indicate the charging status at any time; 

• Beautiful appearance and convenient placement; 

• Low standby power consumption, power saving and environmental protection; 

• Input voltage: DC 5.1V; output current: 2.0A; appearance size: 175*60*55mm; handle charging time: about 3H;

